# Trained model artifacts. Agent SOURCE (main.py / deck.csv / feat_*.py /
# nn_*.py) stays under version control; weights do not.
#   agents/**/*.npz          ~900MB  (numpy policy weights)
#   agents/**/model_*.txt    ~980MB  (LightGBM text dumps)
# Which model belongs to which experiment is recorded in knowledge/experiments/.
*.npz
model_*.txt

# Compiled engine binaries kept as local backups
*.bak
